Winter Update for "Beyond your Fear". Featuring:

 Localizations: Adding full language support for Spanish Portuguese(Brazilian), French and German;
 Achievements: Three Achievements added for each ending;
 UI Rework: Redesigned of the user interface to improve readability;
 Performance Options Improvement: Each Performance option now works as intended, providing better result;
 Sound Improvement: Added even more immersion compared from the last update.
